to support BLM. \n\n\u201cFund us like you want us to win!\u201d\n\nAsh-Lee Woodard Henderson, Highlander Center.\n#BlackLivesMatter #JusticeForGeorgeFloyd","userId":19245146,"media":null,"username":"coyahope","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":54,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":18.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1270553864962531329","date":1591758621000,"rawContent":"I\u2019ve had a very rough day. It all kind of crashed down on me. When you\u2019re trying to get through something, and you finally get a little space, then you realize how hard you\u2019ve been working to keep it together. \n\n#MinneapolisUprising #JusticeForGeorgeFloyd #BlackLivesMatter","userId":19245146,"media":null,"username":"coyahope","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":55,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":19.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1270858363098849280","date":1591831219000,"rawContent":"I\u2019m watching native folks, at the state capitol, they just tore down the statue of Columbus! The commentary tho!!!\n#BlackLivesMatter\u00a0 #Resist #IndigenousResistance","userId":19245146,"media":null,"username":"coyahope","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":56,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":20.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1271593362718629889","date":1592006457000,"rawConte